{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>After enjoying some cherry-blossom viewing with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> in Central Park, I'm riding my bicycle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone, can you guess where I'm about to go?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Home? Cram school? Or the bookstore?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wrong on all counts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I'm heading to Central Park.<PG>
Heading from Central Park to Central Park: that's me, <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most of you must have question marks floating over your heads.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there are cases where the starting point and the destination are the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's―yes, when you've forgotten something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I'm heading back to Central Park to get back something I forgot.<PG>
No, to be precise, rather than forgetting something, I should say I remembered an errand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I forgot this errand, I would disappoint the 40,000 people of Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That event I haven't missed once since the year before last.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That event being held today!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\大食い大会花見.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Everyone! At last, this day has come around again this year!
{PAUSE ""}
　The 70th Motoki Cherry Blossom Festival! And today, we hold its biggest event, the 3rd Motoki-cho Spring Eating Conte<TXSPS>eeeeest!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\clapping-hands1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>Applause rises from all around. There are definitely more people in the park than when I was here with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> a little while ago.<PG>
Looks like I somehow made it in time for the contest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As the favorite to win, I'm the hero. That's why I show up late.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That said, maybe my lateness was a bit half-hearted... I made it back with 5 minutes to spare.<PG>
"Now, contestants! Please come up on stage!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The emcee keeps the greeting short, and the contestants take the stage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One, two, three, four... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hmm, five participants, counting me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every one of them someone I beat last year.<PG>
All the participants <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE> at me, but I brush it off with a big, easy grin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Heh, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="にら">glaring</STYLE> means nothing. Whoever eats is justice!<PG>
On the stage there are chairs and a long table, with six chairs set out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though there are five participants. Is someone running late?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"And now, everyone! Believe it or not, a challenger appears! Please come on out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A challenger? If she's appearing separately from the rest of us, does that mean she's the special guest?<PG>
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
The one who appears when called is a slender woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her age... a little over 20, maybe?<PG>
"Hey, isn't that the champion from the other day?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, yeah! She was on TV!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Champion...? TV...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I take another look at the guest's face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't know her...<PG>
"Well, the venue seems to be starting to buzz... 
{PAUSE ""}
That's right, she is the queen of competitive eating who took her first victory in fine style this past February, two months ago, on 'Big Eating Festival 800 ~Winter Battle~', broadcast nationwide on Japonica TV! It's Shinori <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="みなみざき">Minamizaki</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Nice to meet you. My name is Shinori Minamizaki. I look forward to competing with you."<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\大歓声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
In contrast to the woman's polite greeting, the venue gets wildly excited.
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<BR>
I see, so this person is Japan's eating champion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coming out to an event in Motoki-cho like this, the champion must have time on her hands.<PG>
Still, against an eating champion, I don't think I stand a chance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wouldn't say I've lost the will to fight, but I did eat all sorts of things with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> earlier...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, I'll eat for fun and help keep things lively.<PG>
The seat I'm shown to is right next to the champion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so the idea is to show the difference between the previous champion and the national champion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Feels like I'm being used as a stepping stone, but oh well, never mind, never mind.<PG>
"Last year's champion, <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE>, how about it? How does it feel to sit next to the national champion?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if you ask how it feels, I don't know this person...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="みなみざき">Minamizaki</STYLE>-san is looking my way with a smile that has no spite in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll just make some comment to liven things up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... At last, a challenger who can stand up to me has arrived! Champion or not, I'll send her packing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, being me, I state my resolve a little cheekily, just for form's sake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\clapping-hands1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
And then, applause and cheers in just about the amount I expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, this is kind of a pain...<PG>
"Now, this year's dish is sauce yakisoba! 200 grams a plate!
{PAUSE ""}
　The ingredients are provided by Motoki-cho's kitchen, 'Supermarket Hanamaru'! The cooking is done by the local housewives!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\焼きそば.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
